- Condition uses “empty($site_url) || in_array(...)”, so when auto_generate_site_url is set, a non-empty site_url from the user can be clobbered.
- When 'username' is selected, code assigns raw username without ensuring uniqueness; other branches call wu_generate_unique_site_url().

Proposed fix:

```diff
