body:
_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_ | _🟠 Major_

**Guard against missing locale mapping to avoid notices.**

Direct index into $this->wp_locale_mapping may emit notices if arrays diverge. Add a check with a clear error.

```diff
-            $wp_locale   = $this->wp_locale_mapping[ $deepl_code ];
+            if (!isset($this->wp_locale_mapping[$deepl_code])) {
+                throw new Exception("No WP locale mapping for DeepL code: {$deepl_code}");
+            }
+            $wp_locale = $this->wp_locale_mapping[$deepl_code];
```

