when the expected post isn't found by adding an immediate assertion or fail call
(e.g., $this->assertNotEmpty($inline_post, 'Expected inline post not found') or
$this->fail('Inline post "Template A Post with Inline Image" not found')), then
proceed with the existing content checks and ensure restore_current_blog() is
still called in all paths.
```

