_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Restore the original `force_auto_renew` setting after the test.**

This test hard-sets the setting to `true` at the end, which can leak state if the original value was different.

<details>
<summary>🔧 Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
 	// The auto_renew setting is only applied when force_auto_renew is disabled.
-	wu_save_setting('force_auto_renew', false);
+	$original_force = wu_get_setting('force_auto_renew', true);
+	wu_save_setting('force_auto_renew', false);
@@
-	// Clean up setting
-	wu_save_setting('force_auto_renew', true);
+	// Clean up setting
+	wu_save_setting('force_auto_renew', $original_force);
```
</details>

