<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In `@tests/WP_Ultimo/Checkout/Cart_Test.php` around lines 1341 - 1363, The test
mutates the global setting 'force_auto_renew' and currently resets it to a
hard-coded true, which can leak state; update test_auto_renew_false to read and
save the original value (e.g. $orig = wu_get_setting('force_auto_renew') or
equivalent) before calling wu_save_setting(false), and restore that original
value at the end (use wu_save_setting($orig)); to be robust, perform the restore
