body:
_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Use the WP user ID when setting current user.**

`wp_set_current_user()` expects a WordPress user ID; passing the Ultimo customer ID can set the wrong user and make these tests inaccurate or flaky.

<details>
<summary>🔧 Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
-		$customer_id = $this->customer->get_id();
-		wp_set_current_user($customer_id);
+		$customer_id = $this->customer->get_id();
+		wp_set_current_user($this->customer->get_user_id());
@@
-		$wrong_customer_id = 456;
-		wp_set_current_user($wrong_customer_id);
+		$wrong_customer_id = 456;
+		$other_user_id = self::factory()->user->create();
+		wp_set_current_user($other_user_id);
```
</details>

