_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🔴 Critical_

**Renewal discount is set too late to affect addon line items.**

`add_product()` runs earlier (Line 840), and discounts are applied when line items are added. Setting the membership discount code at Lines 901/1010 does not reprice already-added addon items, so addon totals can remain undiscounted.

<details>
<summary>💡 Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
@@
 		if ($membership_discount_code && $membership_discount_code->should_apply_to_renewals()) {
 			$this->add_discount_code($membership_discount_code);
+			$this->reapply_discounts_to_existing_line_items();
 		}
@@
 		if ($membership_discount_code && $membership_discount_code->should_apply_to_renewals()) {
 			$this->add_discount_code($membership_discount_code);
+			$this->reapply_discounts_to_existing_line_items();
 		}
```

```php
// Add helper in Cart class (outside this hunk)
private function reapply_discounts_to_existing_line_items(): void {
	foreach ($this->line_items as $id => $line_item) {
		if ( ! $line_item->is_discountable()) {
			continue;
		}

		$line_item = $this->apply_discounts_to_item($line_item);

		if ($line_item->is_taxable()) {
			$line_item = $this->apply_taxes_to_item($line_item);
		}

		$this->line_items[$id] = $line_item;
	}
}
```
</details>


