+     * 3. X-Real-IP (Nginx proxy)
+     * 4. X-Forwarded-For (Standard proxy header - first IP only)
+     * 5. REMOTE_ADDR (Direct connection)
+     *
+     * @return string The client IP address.
+     */
+    public static function get_ip_address(): string
+    {
