**Dead code: Assertions after `expectException()` are never executed.**

When `expectException()` is used, PHPUnit expects the test to end with the exception. Lines 432-435 (assertions checking `$json_error`) will never execute because the exception is thrown before reaching them.

To verify the error content, capture it before the exception or use a different assertion pattern.


